15	2	12	Document: ClaimSetu MVP Policy\nSection: SECTION 3: CRITICAL ILLNESS\nClause: 3.2\n\n3.2 Medical Definitions for Critical Illnesses\n• Benign Brain Tumor: A non-cancerous tumor in the brain tissue in space within the skull, causing irreversible\nanatomical or physiological neuro-deficits certified by a neurologist, excluding cysts, granulomas, vascular\nmalformations, hematomas, and tumors of the pituitary gland.\n• Parkinson's Disease: Unequivocal diagnosis of primary Idiopathic Parkinson's Disease by a consultant\nneurologist, resulting in inability to perform at least 3 of the 6 Activities of Daily Living (ADLs) without assistance.\n• Coma of Specified Severity: A state of unconsciousness with no reaction or response to external stimuli or\ninternal needs, continuing for a continuous period of at least 96 hours, requiring life support systems and\nresulting in permanent neurological deficit.	SECTION 3: CRITICAL ILLNESS	\N	3.2	\N	\N	[0.004069439,0.013045208,0.02000697,-0.033593796,0.0061795986,-0.014586358,0.02257225,0.0299246,0.032416947,-0.011437226,-0.025003472,-0.018692657,-0.033338152,0.029767163,0.10400654,0.02065933,-0.024220504,-0.007635699,0.018794807,0.0100955535,0.02422692,-0.0069790347,-0.035027783,-0.024855034,-0.023917107,-0.0119758,0.046958435,0.009337342,0.026671002,0.015611587,0.007521437,-0.0077694166,-0.013104335,0.035076115,0.017434789,0.048579052,0.008528663,-0.041396067,-0.005294455,0.01610645,0.017800169,0.0025963522,0.007438274,-0.0068381997,-0.0021103662,-0.021994192,0.0201615,0.012194067,-0.032819092,0.015719973,-0.00096828974,0.0034570638,0.0033037793,-0.15960678,-0.0019647696,-0.03709576,-0.014816179,-0.025941733,-0.00082492427,-0.008721191,-0.029589405,-0.0085930275,0.004113829,-0.0027771299,-0.011126877,-0.0003387527,0.017773202,0.008263515,-0.03629259,-0.013630679,-0.013017841,0.011939832,0.025922228,-0.018235236,-0.011789201,0.0041438257,0.0076570977,0.016737012,0.010365982,0.010245877,-0.006981762,-0.03554006,0.0020592124,0