16	2	13	Document: ClaimSetu MVP Policy\nSection: SECTION 3: CRITICAL ILLNESS\nClause: 3.2\n\n• Deafness (Total Loss of Hearing): Total and irreversible loss of hearing in both ears as a result of illness or\naccident, certified by an Ear, Nose, and Throat (ENT) specialist with audiometric verification.\n• Fulminant Viral Hepatitis: A sub-massive to massive necrosis of the liver caused by any virus, leading\nprecipitously to liver failure, jaundice, encephalopathy, and liver function impairment.\n• Myocardial Infarction (First Heart Attack): The death of a portion of the heart muscle arising from inadequate\nblood supply, evidenced by typical clinical symptoms, fresh ECG changes, and elevation of cardiac biochemical\nmarkers (Troponin/CK-MB).\n• Heart Valve Replacement: The actual undergoing of open-heart surgery to replace or repair one or more heart\nvalves due to disease or abnormality.	SECTION 3: CRITICAL ILLNESS	\N	3.2	\N	\N	[-0.011984658,-0.0028750887,0.029933045,-0.04419977,0.014496358,0.010251615,0.02635637,0.0014806131,0.021644965,-0.0075270846,-0.017622778,-0.010925009,-0.030750755,0.045670558,0.102099724,0.014545399,-0.016415223,0.009055343,0.020702591,0.005234756,-0.00471801,0.0018846185,-0.02001204,-0.023948582,-0.034125533,0.00013119483,0.0376771,-0.0021195924,0.021715319,0.0033990657,0.0087905815,-0.019703746,-0.0017019213,0.013950792,0.018353224,0.029328795,0.021108666,-0.048236743,0.016371083,0.041429143,0.011483329,0.022592079,-0.0013203379,-0.0004805045,-0.012095153,-0.021533823,0.0144597,0.0155232465,-0.00836357,0.018206496,0.009940507,-0.0017996924,-0.007096815,-0.15669674,-0.0006403596,-0.031571046,0.0026454364,-0.028930614,-0.0041405535,-0.010300887,-0.014987647,-0.00599262,-0.017040927,-0.0026523825,-0.0064628804,0.006703124,-0.002813919,0.008551072,-0.024674881,-0.01585063,-0.028759023,0.03476215,0.030536523,-0.003524948,-0.028337475,-0.0121477945,-0.0022386608,-0.009059051,-0.00896469,0.020113919,-0.020227619,-0.024149248,-0.0023746926,0.000