9	2	6	Document: ClaimSetu MVP Policy\nSection: SECTION 1: ACCIDENTAL INSURANCE\nClause: 1.3\n\n1.3 Section Exceptions (Accidental Insurance)\nThe Company shall not be liable to make any payment under this section for bodily injury, death, or disablement\ndirectly or indirectly caused by, contributed to, or arising from:\n1. Intentional self-injury, suicide, or attempted suicide, while sane or insane.\n2. Accidents sustained while under the influence of intoxicating liquor, drugs, or narcotics, unless prescribed by a\nqualified medical practitioner.\n3. Participation in aviation or aeronautical activities other than as a fare-paying passenger on a recognized\ncommercial airline on a scheduled route.\n4. Engaging in hazardous or extreme sports including, but not limited to, bungee jumping, motor racing, scuba\ndiving, mountaineering requiring ropes or guides, paragliding, and skydiving.\n5. Insanity, mental defect, or underlying psychiatric illness.\n6. Participation in or commission of illegal or criminal acts.\n7. Unnecessary exposure to exceptional danger (except in an attempt to save human life).\n8. War, invasion, act of foreign enemy, hostilities (whether war be declared or not), civil war, rebellion, revolution,\ninsurrection, mutiny, or military usurped power.\n9. Ionizing radiation, radioactivity, nuclear fuel, or nuclear waste.	SECTION 1: ACCIDENTAL INSURANCE	\N	1.3	\N	\N	[0.0064659547,0.019970113,-0.005984825,-0.035145972,0.011690657,0.002919664,0.03341078,0.0034624797,-0.0047388575,-0.013007949,0.0010487343,-0.013423969,-0.032946352,0.030484326,0.11204521,0.0154348025,0.002420696,-0.0025870071,-0.01084729,0.011622028,0.0123291155,0.005341295,-0.0064302087,-0.019711463,-0.02587166,-0.013365913,0.010685802,0.008473501,0.022899333,-0.010485386,-0.009694237,-0.01688569,-0.0018869101,0.016988331,0.05296952,0.01812053,0.01836936,-0.003749535,0.011240679,0.001344767,0.0025855936,0.019354748,-0.012863511,-0.0144385435,0.0052878475,-0.007745692,0.039411813,-0.00270