21	2	18	Document: ClaimSetu MVP Policy\nSection: SECTION 3: CRITICAL ILLNESS\nClause: 3.5\n\n3.5 Section Conditions (Critical Illness)\n1. Non-transferability: Coverage and benefit rights under this section are strictly non-transferable to third parties.\n2. Duty to Mitigate: The Insured Person must take all reasonable precautions and follow prescribed medical\nadvice to mitigate the severity of the illness.\n3. Fraudulent Claims: Any misrepresentation, suppression, or fraudulent declaration invalidates all claims under\nthis policy.\n4. Waiting Period: A mandatory initial waiting period of 30 days applies from the policy inception date. No critical\nillness diagnosed within this period shall be covered.\nGENERAL POLICY CONDITIONS\n1. Uniform Definitions: Words and expressions defined in this Policy Document shall carry the same meaning\nwherever they appear.\n2. Proof of Loss / Claim Documents: The Insured must submit all original medical bills, discharge summaries,\ndiagnostic reports, and completed claim forms within the stipulated timeframe.\n3. Right to Medical Examination: The Company reserves the right to examine the Insured Person or conduct a\npost-mortem at its own expense through an appointed medical practitioner during claim processing.\n4. Policy Expiry: Coverage terminates at midnight on the end date specified in the Policy Schedule.\n5. Renewal Notice: The Company may issue renewal notices up to one month prior to expiry. Renewal is subject\nto mutual agreement and premium payment before policy lapse.\n6. Misrepresentation and Voidance: This policy shall be voidable ab initio in the event of misrepresentation,\ndeliberate non-disclosure, or fraud regarding material facts.\n7. Premium Receipts: Premium payments are valid only when supported by official printed receipts issued by the\nCompany.\n8. Fraudulent Claims: If any claim under this policy is in any respect fraudulent, all benefits hereunder shall be\nforfeited.\n9. Litigation Time Limits: No legal action may be brought against the Company after the expiry of 3 months from\nthe final rejection of a claim, nor unless written notification of the dispute is served within 35 days of the cause of\naction.\n10. Written Communications: All notices and communications to the Company must be submitted in writing to its\nregistered office address.\n11. Burden of Proof: In any claim dispute or legal proceeding, the burden of proving that a loss or illness falls\nwithin the scope of policy coverage rests entirely upon the Insured Person.	SECTION 3: CRITICAL ILLNESS	\N	3.5	\N	\N	[-0.0012857913,0.024963545,0.0047944123,-0.03935121,0.0026262703,0.0034410118,0.022338813,0.000873041,0.021154802,-5.428718e-05,-0.017565027,-0.020445107,-0.015230331,0.018917806,0.114441596,0.021940524,-0.011613739,-0.013163376,0.038552295,0.0021119942,-0.0010453474,0.017176572,-0.016230036,-0.004237941,-0.022316277,0.00093259435,-0.008013947,0.018794533,0.015370871,0.029318558,-2.5525022e-05,-0.004985464,-0.015699936,0.02485143,0.005691524,0.023269905,0.008887186,-0.021549657,-0.006094391,0.025158634,0.0058958773,0.03036667,-0.02465618,-0.023722796,-0.014206348,-0.025633615,0.026512532,0.006400959,-0.03427818,0.03856476,0.010607829,0.0020206207,-0.0029893569,-0.16369994,-0.00066065363,-0.045307554,-0.0074793897,0.004065655,0.01583427,-0.01837291,-0.02208419,0.007594767,-0.00086775474,-0.007104384,0.0010801724,-0.011256639,-0.0009973084,-0.0022187463,-0.031811718,-0.016851349,-0.028308926,0.003978905,0.010252466,-0.010364947,-0.0018668167,-0.0007522849,-0.0051005064,0.017792847,0.013690395,-0.006634985,-0.01153489,-0.0183306,-0.007955765,-0.030592294,0.013448093,0.0030287465,-0.0031281584,0.010001034,0.009128559,-0.0014277144,0.011689525,0.011649005,0.0043245177,0.0061748247,0.004840027,0.009947561,0.0009768201,-0.008296823,-0.0022064508,0.0037988806,-0.0064448533,-0.046852365,-0.026638957,-0.020198086,0.0037155272,-0.0193771,-0.0050214822,0.009137695,-0.0030194346,0.006041661,0.019782644,-0.020